	<section_number>3.2-2303</section_number>
	<catch_line>Soybean Board officers and compensation</catch_line>
	<text>
		<section prefix="A">The Soybean Board shall elect a chairman and such other officers as deemed appropriate.
		</section>
		<section prefix="B">Members of the Soybean Board shall not receive compensation for attendance at meetings of the Soybean Board, but shall be reimbursed for actual expenses incurred in such attendance.
		</section>
	</text>
	<history>1970, c. 431, § 3.1-684.13; 1974, c. 297; 1978, c. 540; 1985, c. 448; 1987, c. 476; 2008, c. 860.</history>
